     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 4 TO WS-DIR
     CALL "PORTAL-FACE-QUAD" USING WS-TYPE WS-DIR WS-CORNERS
     MOVE "gateway WEST face corners are (0, 1, 0) (0, 0, 0) (0, 0, 1) (0, 1, 1)" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM TEXT-CORNERS
